olor scheme\n   363→- **Gotcha**: The sage-green palette feels more modern and contemporary while still being feminine and elegant\n   364→- **Gotcha**: Playfair Display + Inter font pairing is slightly more modern/readable than Cormorant Garamond + Montserrat\n   365→- **Gotcha**: Adding 4th blob with lower opacity creates additional depth without overwhelming the design\n   366→- **Performance**: All animations use GPU-accelerated properties (transform, opacity) for smooth 60fps performance\n   367→- **Mobile optimization**: Enhanced hover states disabled on touch devices, stacked layouts for smaller screens\n   368→\n   369→**Codebase Patterns Added**:\n   370→- **Serene Sage & Pearl Palette**: `--color-sage: #9CBFA8`, `--color-sage-dark: #7FA68C`, `--color-pearl: #F8F6F3`, `--color-mint: #D4E5DC`, `--color-golden: #C4A77D` - fresh, natural aesthetic\n   371→- **Dual Organic Border Radius**: `--radius-organic: 60% 40% 30% 70% / 60% 30% 70% 40%` and `--radius-organic-2: 40% 60% 70% 30% / 40% 70% 30% 60%` for more dynamic blob animations\n   372→- **Pulsing Ring Animation**: CSS animation on differential icons creates subtle attention-grabbing effect without being distracting\n   373→- **Twilight Lavender & Mocha Palette**: `--color-lavender: #B8A5C4`, `--color-lavender-dark: #9A84A8`, `--color-mocha: #C4B5A8`, `--color-mocha-dark: #A89484`, `--color-champagne: #F5EDE3` - contemporary, fashion-forward aesthetic\n   374→- **Triple Organic Border Radius**: Third pattern `--radius-organic-3: 50% 50% 40% 60% / 50% 40% 60% 50%` for even more variety in blob animations\n   375→\n   376→---\n   377→\n   378→## 2025-02-08 - US-050\n   379→- Created complete website for Dra. Amanda Gaipo - Harmonização Facial em Ribeirão Preto\n   380→- Files changed:\n   381→  - `site-demo/dra-amanda-gaipo/index.html` (new)\n   382→- **Design Concept**: Twilight Lavender & Mocha aesthetic with warm lavender, soft mocha, and champagne accents. Contemporary and fashion-forward while maintain