{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_20260209025641c9ccd2b4d88f4990","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-4.7","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Now I'll create the website for Dra. Brenda Dick. Based on the progress.md, I need to create a completely new aesthetic direction that hasn't been used before. Let me analyze what's been used and create something unique:\n\n**Already used palettes:** Pearl & Titanium, Golden Champagne & Pearl, Copper & Rose Quartz, Ruby & Antique Silver, Ivory & Emerald, Amethyst & Platinum, Sapphire & Champagne, Sage & Pearl, Lavender & Mocha, Emerald & Silk, Rose & Quartz, Amber & Bronze, Plum & Gold, Pearl & Mink, Opal & Dusty Rose, Coral & Seafoam, Burgundy & Gold, Porcelain & Rouge\n\nI'll create a **Bronze & Celadon Noir** aesthetic - warm bronze metallic tones paired with cool celadon green ceramic glaze colors on dark noir backgrounds. This creates a sophisticated, modern aesthetic that's completely different from all previous palettes."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8676b3eb-c729-4b4a-bd7a-dc643bff46cb","uuid":"b03c90d2-75b7-4797-bef0-ea2a3323da37"}
