{"type":"assistant","message":{"id":"msg_202602090305408e6ad2f8c6df419f","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"glm-4.7","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I have successfully completed the website for Dra. Brenda Dick - Harmonização Facial e Odontologia Especializada. Here's a summary of what was created:\n\n## US-076 - Dra. Brenda Dick Website - COMPLETE ✓\n\n### Design Concept: Bronze & Celadon Noir\n\nI created a completely new aesthetic direction that has never been used before in this project:\n\n**Color Palette:**\n- **Bronze Metallic**: Warm bronze tones (#B8874A, #D4A868, #C89855)\n- **Celadon Ceramic**: Cool celadon green glaze colors (#7AA892, #98C0AA, #629878)\n- **Noir & Ivory**: Soft noir charcoal (#1A1A1A) on warm ivory backgrounds (#FAFAF6)\n\nThis palette is inspired by Asian celadon ceramics with bronze accents, creating an elegant, artistic aesthetic that feels sophisticated and culturally refined.\n\n**Typography:**\n- **Display**: Playfair Display (elegant serif)\n- **Body**: Outfit (modern geometric sans-serif)\n\n**Shape Pattern:**\n- **Ceramic Curve Border Radius**: Smooth, flowing shapes reminiscent of hand-crafted pottery\n\n### Key Features Implemented:\n- ✓ Animated hero with 4 floating ceramic curve-shaped backgrounds\n- ✓ Auto-hiding navigation with smooth scroll\n- ✓ Problem/Solution section (6 cards total)\n- ✓ 6 Service cards\n- ✓ 3 Testimonial cards\n- ✓ 6 Differential items with pulsing icons\n- ✓ Contact form with WhatsApp integration\n- ✓ Fully responsive for mobile, tablet, and desktop\n- ✓ Intersection Observer animations\n- ✓ Parallax effect on mouse movement\n- ✓ Accessibility features (prefers-reduced-motion, semantic HTML)\n\n### File Created:\n- `site-demo/dra-brenda-dick-harmonizacao-facial-e-odontologia-especializ/index.html` (1486 lines)\n\n### Demo URL:\n`pixelalchemy.com.br/site-demo/dra-brenda-dick-harmonizacao-facial-e-odontologia-especializ`\n\n### Contact Info:\n- **Address**: Av. Braz Olaia Acosta, 1900 - Sala 410 - Nova Aliança, Ribeirão Preto - SP, 14026-040\n- **Phone**: (16) 99371-8919\n\nThe progress.md file has been updated with the new codebase pattern (Bronze & Celadon Noir Palette, Ceramic Curve Border Radius, and Playfair Display + Outfit Typography) and detailed learnings from this implementation.\n\n<promise>COMPLETE</promise>"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":0,"output_tokens":0},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8676b3eb-c729-4b4a-bd7a-dc643bff46cb","uuid":"923fdfa6-ce86-4522-97fb-c8c702f7a80c"}
